    "summary": "Feather ornament. Double braid of narrow flax-leaf strips, curved, forming loop at one end, with black/brown hawk (?) and smaller white feathers tied into nine bundles with narrow strips of flax and/or flax-fibre strings before assembling on braids. Dark feathers have been split in half and typical bundle is made up of 18 half feathers and 3 smaller white ones; when assembled, white feathers are at convex top of each bundle.",
